{# Widget "offline" — every post that is late, silent or offline.

   THE ONLY READING IN WHICH AN OFFLINE POST CANNOT BE MISSED, which is the
   whole reason the direction it leads exists. Late is a warning and not a
   fault: it clears itself the moment something lands, and nothing here is
   dismissed by hand. #}
<div class="c">
    <span class="tab">Silent &amp; offline<span class="src">&middot; {{ dash.quiet|length }} of {{ dash.posts|length }}</span></span>
    {% for post in dash.quiet|slice(0, 6) %}
        <div class="rset">
            <span class="lb"><b>{{ post.stationName }}</b><em>{{ post.state.label }}</em></span>
            <span class="ct"><span class="r-sh {{ post.state.value == 'offline' ? 'st-fail' : 'st-warn' }}"><i></i>{{ post.state.label }}</span></span>
            <span class="why">{% if post.silentFor is not null %}nothing has landed for {{ post.silentFor }} minutes{% else %}nothing has landed inside this post&rsquo;s silence window{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
    {% else %}
        <div class="rfrag"><b>Every post on the books is reporting</b><em>each has something newer than its own silence window</em></div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
